        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="field"><label>Assigned To</label><select id="w_assignedTo"><option value="">— Unassigned —</option></select><div class="field-hint">Whoever's responsible for the next step on this case — they'll get tagged in Slack when something changes.</div></div>
      <div class="field"><label>Where is this case right now?</label><div class="stage-picker" id="stagePicker"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wz-page" id="wpage2">
      <div class="wz-question">When are the appointments?</div>
      <div class="wz-hint">Enter the dates for the records appointment and surgery. It's okay if you don't have them yet — you can add them later.</div>
      <div class="field-grid">
        <div class="field"><label>Records Appointment Date</label><input id="w_recDate" type="date"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Records Status</label><select id="w_recStatus"><option value="not-scheduled">Not booked yet</option><option value="scheduled">Booked ✓</option><option value="completed">Done ✓✓</option></select></div>
