        </div>
        <div class="confirm-warn" id="meetWarn" style="display:none;margin-top:10px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field-grid">
        <div class="field"><label>Surgery Date</label><input id="w_surDate" type="date" onchange="scheduleRecalc();autoFillFollowUpDate()"></div>
      <div class="toggle-row" style="margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:4px;"><div class="toggle-info"><div class="toggle-label">Track Final Restoration?</div><div class="toggle-sub">Turn on if we might make the final restoration after surgery — follow-up date auto-fills 105 days after surgery</div></div><div class="tgl" id="tgl_final" onclick="tgl('final');autoFillFollowUpDate()"></div></div>
      <div id="final_ex" style="display:none;margin-top:4px;margin-bottom:8px;">
        <div class="field-grid">
          <div class="field"><label>Doctor's Decision</label><select id="w_finDec"><option value="pending">Waiting to hear back</option><option value="yes">Yes — we will make it</option><option value="no">No — going elsewhere</option><option value="undecided">Not sure yet</option></select></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Follow-up Date <span style="font-size:10px;color:var(--teal);font-weight:600;">(auto: surgery +105 days)</span></label><input id="w_finFollowDate" type="date"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Estimated Start Date</label><input id="w_finFabStart" type="date"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>Target Delivery Date</label><input id="w_finFabDel" type="date"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label>Notes (material, shade, etc.)</label><textarea id="w_finNotes" placeholder="e.g. Zirconia, shade A2..."></textarea></div>
      </div>
        <div class="field"><label>Surgery Status</label><select id="w_surStatus"><option value="not-scheduled">Not booked yet</option><option value="scheduled">Booked ✓</option><option value="completed">Done ✓✓</option><option value="rescheduled">Rescheduled</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field"><label>Scheduling Notes</label><textarea id="w_schedNotes" placeholder="e.g. Patient prefers mornings, needs 2 weeks notice..."></textarea></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wz-page" id="wpage3">
      <div class="wz-question">What's happening in the lab?</div>
      <div class="wz-hint">Fill in what you know. You can always update this later as the case moves forward.</div>
      <div class="field-grid">
        <div class="field"><label>Technician Design Finished Date</label><input id="w_meetDate" type="date"><div class="field-hint">ⓘ Fills in automatically based on the surgery date and guide type — no need to type it yourself.</div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Design Status</label><select id="w_meetStatus" onchange="updateStageSubStatus()"><option value="not-scheduled">Not started yet</option><option value="scheduled">In progress</option><option value="completed">Finished ✓</option></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Fabrication Start Date</label><input id="w_fabStart" type="date"><div class="field-hint">ⓘ Fills in automatically — you can still edit it if the actual schedule is different.</div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Expected Finish Date</label><input id="w_fabEnd" type="date"><div class="field-hint">ⓘ Fills in automatically — you can still edit it if the actual schedule is different.</div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Guide Delivery Date</label><input id="w_delDate" type="date"><div class="field-hint">ⓘ Fills in automatically — you can still edit it if the actual schedule is different.</div></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Delivery Status</label><select id="w_delStatus" onchange="updateStageSubStatus()"><option value="pending">Not sent yet</option><option value="shipped">Shipped 📦</option><option value="delivered">Delivered ✓</option></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="toggle-row"><div class="toggle-info"><div class="toggle-label">Does this case need a Scan Appliance?</div><div class="toggle-sub">Only about 1 in 100 cases need this — ask your supervisor if unsure</div></div><div class="tgl" id="tgl_scan" onclick="tgl('scan')"></div></div>
      <div id="scan_ex" style="display:none;margin-top:10px;"><div class="field-grid"><div class="field"><label>Scan Appliance Ordered</label><input id="w_scanOrd" type="date"></div><div class="field"><label>Scan Appliance Received</label><input id="w_scanRec" type="date"></div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="wz-page" id="wpage4">
      <div class="wz-question">Almost done! Files and final notes.</div>
      <div class="wz-hint">Let us know if all the files came in, and add any notes about this case.</div>
      <div class="field-grid">
        <div class="field"><label>Files Received?</label><select id="w_filesStatus"><option value="pending">Not yet received</option><option value="partial">Some files missing</option><option value="complete">All files received ✓</option></select></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Date Files Received</label><input id="w_recDone" type="date"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field"><label>What files are missing? (if any)</label><textarea id="w_filesNotes" placeholder="e.g. Still waiting for the CBCT scan..."></textarea></div>
      <!-- Track Final Restoration fields are on Page 2 below surgery date -->
      <div class="field"><label>General Notes</label><textarea id="w_notes" placeholder="Anything else the team should know about this case?"></textarea></div>
    </div>
  </div>
